{"id":"00232","root":"uni00232_1","name":{"ja":"鳳　朱華","en":"Ootori Shuka"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"鳳　朱華","en":"Ootori Shuka"},"aliases":["Hou Shuka"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-08-31","limited":true,"characterId":172,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園の学生対魔忍。アサギやゆきかぜといった強豪の中で研鑽をつむ対魔忍。左目に邪眼“先望眼”を宿している。これは一種の先読みをつかさどる邪眼であり、対象の行動予期が行える。防御時には自身に向かってくる攻撃が立体的に見え、的確な防御や回避ができる。攻勢時には有効な攻撃のビジョンが見え、それをなぞる様に動く事で効率的な攻撃を相手に叩き込むことができる。とはいえ、見えたビジョンの通りに動くには相当の身体能力を要することも多く、特に格上の相手との戦いでは防御に重点を置いて邪眼を使っている。この能力は、左目を閉じる事で強制的に解除できる。そんな特異な能力を持ちながら、ほかの対魔忍たちに並び立ち、追い越すべく鍛錬を欠かさない生真面目な性格。あまり遊びにも興味を持たず、対魔忍として優秀であることが人生の目標。そのため、恋愛においては非常にうぶである。","en":"Ootori Shuka is a student Taimanin at Gosha Academy. She trains among strong peers such as Asagi and Mizuki Yukikaze. She possesses the evil eye \"Sakimōgan\" in her left eye. This precognitive eye lets her anticipate opponents' actions. When defending, attacks coming at her appear three-dimensional, allowing precise blocks or dodges. When on the offensive, she sees a vision of an effective attack and can replicate it, striking efficiently. However, following the vision demands great physical ability, so against superior foes she mainly uses the eye for defense. She can deactivate the ability by closing her left eye. Despite this unique power, she trains relentlessly to stand shoulder-to-shoulder with other Taimanin and surpass them. She is serious and has little interest in play; excelling as a Taimanin is her life's goal. Consequently, she is very naïve when it comes to romance."},"illustrator":"なまにくATK","voiceActor":"新山ゆうき","forms":[{"id":"uni00232_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1060,2120],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[129,258],"def":[117,234],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["3","300001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00232_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"