ext":{"ja":"今のままじゃダメ……。せっかくの能力を、もっと使いこなせるようになりたいの","en":"I can't stay like this… I want to master my ability properly."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ちょっと、なにチラチラ見てるの？　ど、どうせ、エッチなことでも考えてたんでしょ？","en":"Hey, what are you staring at? You're probably thinking about something lewd, aren't you?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"え、エッチなことくらい、できるわよ。半人前でも、一応は対魔忍なんだからっ……！","en":"Huh, I can handle lewd stuff. Even if I'm still a rookie, I'm still a Taimanin after all…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"あ、あの。さっきは、悪かったわ……。あれは、勘違いだったけど、でも……気持ちよかった","en":"Um… I'm sorry about earlier… That was a misunderstanding, but… it felt good."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"ねぇ……。また、ああいうこと、してくれる……？　って、私なに言ってるんだろ。ごめん、忘れてっ！","en":"Hey… will you do that again…? Wait, what am I even saying? Sorry, I forgot!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00232_1/uni00232_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","varian